 for enrollees aged 5–64 years overall and by sex and age group\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical testing was not performed because the size of the MarketScan database often results in significant p-values that are not clinically meaningful.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Annual percent change is calculated as the difference between percentage in one year and that in the preceding year\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}